# Only requirements.txt, app/, data/horizon/ and data/site_slopes.json are copied into the image; keep local
# artefacts out of the build context so builds are reproducible and nothing private or platform-specific
# leaks into a layer. (The elevation patches in data/site_slopes/ are not needed at run time.)
*
!requirements.txt
!app/
!data/horizon/
!data/site_slopes.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
# Local scientific data (the kernels a developer downloaded, LOLA DEMs): the image gets its kernels from
# NAIF with pinned checksums instead (Dockerfile), never from a developer's disk.
app/physics/data/
